    "version": 3,
    "description": "What the Assign screen looks like after pressing Assign from the None-grouping multi-select (3 individual signals: Mike x2, Kathleen). Simplified/shortened per feedback: no heading, no per-signal message list, no redundant 'will create sender rules for' callout — just the distinct contacts as WhatsApp-icon chips, an Assign-By choice (Contact/Group only, 'These signals only' removed), and the project picker. Defaults to 'By Contact' since the selection spans multiple contacts.",
